!include _style.iuml
@startuml
!include _style.iuml
' https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/scripts/aws/v1/definitions.py#L596
' https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/scripts/aws/v1/definitions.py#L1267-L1301
' https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/handlers.py#L52
' https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/worker/sqs.py#L309-L345
 title Deployment view · four physical queue lanes and consumers · dc2-live at 76282d3
 left to right direction
 skinparam defaultFontSize 20
 skinparam ArrowFontSize 18
 skinparam titleFontSize 21
 skinparam LegendFontSize 18
 skinparam nodesep 24
 skinparam ranksep 22
 node "MediaRepair" as mr $MEDIA
 node "Processing relay\nProcessingCommands\nProcessingRepair\nProcessingEcsEvents\nProcessingS3Events" as relay $PROC
 queue "ProcessingCommandsQueue\n+ ProcessingCommandsDlq" as cq $INFRA
 queue "ProcessingWorkQueue\n+ ProcessingWorkDlq" as wq $INFRA
 queue "ProcessingShortWorkQueue\n+ ProcessingShortWorkDlq" as sq $INFRA
 queue "MediaResultsQueue\n+ MediaResultsDlq" as rq $INFRA
 node "ProcessingCommands\ncommand_handler" as pc $PROC
 node "Fargate worker · 0..3\nReceiveMessage / Delete" as w $PROC
 node "ProcessingShortEncoder\nshort_encoder_handler" as sh $PROC
 node "MediaResults\nresult_handler" as res $MEDIA
 mr --> cq : command send
 cq --> pc : mapping\nbatch 10 / cap 2
 relay --> wq : standard work send
 relay --> sq : short work send
 relay --> rq : result send
 wq --> w : returned work\n(no mapping)
 sq --> sh : mapping\nbatch 1 / cap 2
 rq --> res : mapping\nbatch 10 / cap 2
 legend bottom
 Blue Media · amber Processing · slate SQS outside VPC.
 Arrows: message sends / delivery. Standard work is returned to a polling worker.
 Every source queue → matching DLQ after 5 receives. Standard visibility 420 s; short 960 s.
 Encoders commit result SQL outbox; relays send. Command/result mappings: window 1 s; partial failures.
 endlegend
@enduml
